  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"newsroom.html\">Newsroom</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">Testimonials</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Customers</p>\n        <h1 class=\"display\">What teams say once the report lands.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Reviews from comms, marketing and investor relations teams who moved a campaign to PressCosmos. Names and organisations are shown as given.</p>\n        \n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight pt-0\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"callout callout-answer\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Quick answer</strong>\n  PressCosmos customers are communications, marketing and investor relations teams ranging from funded startups to public companies and PR agencies. Reviews consistently cite editorial review speed, pickup reporting quality, and AI citation tracking as the reasons they switched or added PressCosmos alongside an incumbent wire.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"card-grid\">\n<figure class=\"card spotlight quote-card\" data-reveal>\n  <div style=\"color:var(--violet);width:26px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.5 6C6.9 7.4 5.4 9.6 5.4 12.4c0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2zM19 6c-2.6 1.4-4.1 3.6-4.1 6.4 0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2z\"/></svg></div>\n  <blockquote class=\"quote-text\">We ran the same funding announcement through two wires. PressCosmos got us quoted inside AI answers within 48 hours, which the other service never did.</blockquote>\n  <figcaption class=\"quote-foot\">\n    <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">PR</span>\n    <span><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Priya Raghunathan</strong><span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Head of Communications, Northwind Robotics</span></span>\n  </figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"card spotlight quote-card\" data-reveal>\n  <div style=\"color:var(--violet);width:26px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.5 6C6.9 7.4 5.4 9.6 5.4 12.4c0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2zM19 6c-2.6 1.4-4.1 3.6-4.1 6.4 0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2z\"/></svg></div>\n  <blockquote class=\"quote-text\">The pickup map alone changed how we plan launches. We can see which metros actually care before we spend on the next one.</blockquote>\n  <figcaption class=\"quote-foot\">\n    <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">DO</span>\n    <span><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Daniel Okonkwo</strong><span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">VP Marketing, Ledgerline Financial</span></span>\n  </figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"card spotlight quote-card\" data-reveal>\n  <div style=\"color:var(--violet);width:26px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.5 6C6.9 7.4 5.4 9.6 5.4 12.4c0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2zM19 6c-2.6 1.4-4.1 3.6-4.1 6.4 0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2z\"/></svg></div>\n  <blockquote class=\"quote-text\">Editorial review is fast without being sloppy. They caught a compliance issue our legal team had missed.</blockquote>\n  <figcaption class=\"quote-foot\">\n    <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">MA</span>\n    <span><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Marta Alvés</strong><span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Director of Investor Relations, Halcyon Therapeutics</span></span>\n  </figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"card spotlight quote-card\" data-reveal>\n  <div style=\"color:var(--violet);width:26px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.5 6C6.9 7.4 5.4 9.6 5.4 12.4c0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2zM19 6c-2.6 1.4-4.1 3.6-4.1 6.4 0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2z\"/></svg></div>\n  <blockquote class=\"quote-text\">As an agency we run 40 client releases a quarter through PressCosmos. The white-label reporting sold our retainer renewal on its own.</blockquote>\n  <figcaption class=\"quote-foot\">\n    <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">TB</span>\n    <span><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Tom Beaudry</strong><span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Partner, Signal & Co.</span></span>\n  </figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"card spotlight quote-card\" data-reveal>\n  <div style=\"color:var(--violet);width:26px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.5 6C6.9 7.4 5.4 9.6 5.4 12.4c0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2zM19 6c-2.6 1.4-4.1 3.6-4.1 6.4 0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2z\"/></svg></div>\n  <blockquote class=\"quote-text\">Our newsroom on our own domain finally ranks for our category terms. It stopped being a press page and started being an asset.</blockquote>\n  <figcaption class=\"quote-foot\">\n    <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">AK</span>\n    <span><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Aisha Karim</strong><span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Brand Director, Verso Living</span></span>\n  </figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"card spotlight quote-card\" data-reveal>\n  <div style=\"color:var(--violet);width:26px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.5 6C6.9 7.4 5.4 9.6 5.4 12.4c0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2zM19 6c-2.6 1.4-4.1 3.6-4.1 6.4 0 3 1.7 4.9 4 4.9 2 0 3.4-1.4 3.4-3.3 0-1.9-1.3-3.2-3.1-3.2h-.5c.2-1.3 1.2-2.4 2.6-3.2z\"/></svg></div>\n  <blockquote class=\"quote-text\">Crisis lane published a holding statement for us at 2am. That response time is worth the plan on its own.</blockquote>\n  <figcaption class=\"quote-foot\">\n    <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">GL</span>\n    <span><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:var(--step--1)\">Greg Lindqvist</strong><span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">General Counsel, Arcline Logistics</span></span>\n  </figcaption>\n</figure></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.5rem);border-radius:var(--r-xl)\">\n    \n<div class=\"stat-row\" data-stagger>\n  <div>\n    <p class=\"stat-value\"><span data-count=\"4.8\">0</span><span class=\"gradient-text\">/5</span></p>\n    <p class=\"stat-label\">Average customer rating</p>\n  </div><div>\n    <p class=\"stat-value\"><span data-count=\"91\">0</span><span class=\"gradient-text\">%</span></p>\n    <p class=\"stat-label\">Would recommend</p>\n  </div><div>\n    <p class=\"stat-value\"><span data-count=\"87\">0</span><span class=\"gradient-text\">%</span></p>\n    <p class=\"stat-label\">Renew on a Studio plan</p>\n  </div><div>\n    <p class=\"stat-value\"><span data-count=\"2400\">0</span><span class=\"gradient-text\">+</span></p>\n    <p class=\"stat-label\">Teams served</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n    <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">Ratings collected from post-campaign surveys. We publish unfavourable feedback on request — ask us for the raw file.</p>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Add your own result to this page.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">Run one release and judge the reporting against whatever you use today.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"submit.html\">Submit a press release</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"pricing.html\">See pricing</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">No subscription required · Cancel anytime · Human editorial review on every release</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
